# Root-context default deny. In particular, .env*, .git, graphify-out,
# node_modules, __pycache__, *.pyc, source media, and test fixtures never enter
# the documented `docker build -f infra/novita/Dockerfile ... .` context.
**
!infra/
infra/*
!infra/novita/
infra/novita/*
!infra/novita/Dockerfile
!infra/novita/worker.py
